I am very hungry.
The shopping is finally done.
Now I am making a quick lunch.
I do not want to cook now.
I take the bread roll from the bakery.
I cut the bread roll.
I do not need any butter.
But I want cheese.
I cut the Emmentaler.
The cheese smells good.
I put the cheese on the bread roll.
Then I make a coffee.
I take the plate and the cup.
I go to the window.
It is bright and quiet here.
I eat the bread roll and drink the coffee.
I like this lunch.
It is simple and very delicious.
